; STRB's final bound has exactly two exhaustive classes.  Ordinary CUR<=LEN
; consumes EXPS(41); the sole overshoot CUR=LEN+1 consumes EXPX.  Both are
; permissive and return zero, and neither changes the already-complete trace.
